From 0f0680998d781ca284abc8d0d51811e34610fd5f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yan Markman <ymarkman@marvell.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 12:41:04 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] marvell: gbsyncd phy add rd98DX35xx_cn9131 device hwsku
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add Marvell Prestera external-PHY gbsyncd support.

PHYs are driven by a separate gbsyncd container (syncd -g 1, GB_ASIC_DB) using the
same mrvllibsai/libsai.so as main syncd, with gearbox_config.json, context_config.json,
and per-PHY hwsku JSON. Build with INCLUDE_GBSYNCD=y.

First board: AC5X-RD-ext (rd98DX35xx_cn9131) — gbsyncd.ini, context/gearbox/phy0-6 configs, psai.profile.

Signed-off-by: Yan Markman <ymarkman@marvell.com>
